      "desktop_responsibility": "Own Coordinator inference request admission versus terminal turn settlement, preserving the original request identity when awaitTurn is explicitly true.",
      "desktop_owner": "coordinator",
      "desktop_visible_effect": "Ordinary sends return after durable admission, while workflow-reference/explicit awaitTurn requests do not settle until the accepted operation completes, is interrupted, or fails.",
